The MKoT is an awesome artifact, if fewer than 2 artifacts already
exist that should definitely be your next wish.  Remember it will
blast you for at least 20 HP when you receive it - but as a level 9
orc that shouldn't be fatal.

The BoH is an important item, but if you still have enough inventory
slots or a plain sack and you aren't burdened, then it can be delayed
for quite a while.  Remember to wish for it blessed and greased.

It is important to remember that if you are saving wishes for later,
you want to be extra-careful not to let your wand get destroyed by an
electrical shock.  Therefore, keep the wand in a sack or drop it
before doing anything that might result in a shock - looting a
(possibly trapped) chest,opening a (possibly trapped) door, sitting on
a throne, standing next to water.

> After that it becomes a little less clear.
