> don't have any gloves, so these seem like a good choice.

If you are planning on using thrown daggers as your primary attack,
blessed fixed +2 gauntlets of power should be right there on your wish
list.  You should also be considering using enchanted orcish daggers
for your stack, I think. The extra thrown dagger from your racial
bonus would more than compensate for the lower damage.

> Should I wish for a better helmet?

Hmm.  I don't think you need to be thinking about that yet.  You
should be trying on all non-cursed helmets that you find, but I don't
think the boost from a helm of telepathy would be worth a wish at this
point.

